  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Development Volunteering Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The International Development Volunteering Programme will provide &#xA3;100m over six years, initially, to support people (particularly, but not necessarily exclusively, young people) to volunteer in projects that support FCDO&#x2019;s development objectives. The programme will initially focus on a small number of ODA-eligible countries, to be determined during the design stage. There will be a strong focus on social mobility, improving employability and strengthening community-based partnerships to give volunteers an opportunity to participate directly in contributing to UK international development programmes.</narrative>
  </description>
